  "description": "Cross-platform binary analysis library — zero WPF dependency.\n\n      Provides portable services for binary data analysis, export/import formats,\n      statistics, template compilation and anomaly detection:\n      • DataInspectorService — multi-format byte interpretation (int/float/date/network/GUID)\n      • IntelHexService — Intel HEX (.hex) import/export\n      • SRecordService — Motorola S-Record (.s19/.s28/.s37) import/export\n      • DataStatisticsService — Shannon entropy, byte distribution, data type estimation\n      • BinaryTemplateCompiler — C-like template compiler (010 Editor compatible)\n      • AnomalyDetectionService — entropy-based anomaly and corruption detection\n\n      Targets .NET 8.0+ (no Windows-specific APIs).\n      Usable in WPF, WinForms, console, ASP.NET and cross-platform applications.",
